{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2148","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2148/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2148/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2148/events","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/issues/2148","id":585024667,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1ODUwMjQ2Njc=","number":2148,"title":"TS type defs for inject query is wrong","user":{"login":"rburgst","id":22971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst","html_url":"https://github.com/rburgst","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburgst/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":451588686,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTE1ODg2ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":"Confirmed bug"},{"id":772309804,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NzIzMDk4MDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/labels/typescript","name":"typescript","color":"0061ca","default":false,"description":"TypeScript related"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2020-03-20T12:03:28Z","updated_at":"2020-05-04T10:28:48Z","closed_at":"2020-05-04T10:28:40Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Report\r\n\r\nafter updating from fastify 2.12.1 to 2.13.0 the typescript definition for `fastify.inject` only supports a `string` for the `query` option.\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\nPaste your code here:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n      const response = await fastify.inject({\r\n        method: 'GET',\r\n        url: `/myuri`,\r\n        query: {\r\n          param: 'value',\r\n        },\r\n      })\r\n```\r\nnow throws a ts compiler error. Previously this was working fine.\r\n\r\nThe problem appears to stem from wrong typedefs in `light-my-request/index.d.ts` where query is defined as a string\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n\r\n  interface InjectOptions {\r\n    url?: string | {\r\n      pathname: string\r\n      protocal?: string\r\n      hostname?: string\r\n      port?: string | number\r\n      query?: string\r\n    }\r\n    path?: string | {\r\n      pathname: string\r\n      protocal?: string\r\n      hostname?: string\r\n      port?: string | number\r\n      query?: string\r\n    }\r\n    headers?: http.IncomingHttpHeaders | http.OutgoingHttpHeaders\r\n =>   query?: string\r\n``` \r\n## Expected behavior\r\n\r\nthe above code should compile and work just as before.\r\n\r\n## Your Environment\r\n\r\n- *node version*: 12.13\r\n- *fastify version*: >=2.13.0\r\n- *os*: Mac\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mcollina","id":52195,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52195?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina","html_url":"https://github.com/mcollina","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/followers","followin